OL,3,GNEWSACovid grants hid museum's
OL,4,Afinancial woes, says director
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe director of a museum has said that
OL,7,Fhaving staff furloughed and grants from
OL,8,Fthe government during the Covid-19
OL,9,Fpandemic hid some of its financial
OL,10,Fissues.
OL,12,F"It's a sad day for Shire Hall," said
OL,13,FVirginia Smith who has worked at the
OL,14,Fmuseum in Dorchester, Dorset, from 2024
OL,15,Funtil it closed on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe Grade I listed building was
OL,18,Fdedicated to the history of justice and
OL,19,Fhome to the courtroom where the
OL,20,FTolpuddle Martyrs were tried in 1834 in
OL,21,Fwhat is widely regarded as a defining
OL,22,Fmoment in the trade union movement.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
