OL,3,GNEWSACovid grants hid museum's
OL,4,Afinancial woes, says director
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe museum opened in May 2018 following
OL,7,Fa #2.9m revamp but its closure came
OL,8,Fafter what trustee Rose Wallis said had
OL,9,Fbeen "several years of challenging
OL,10,Feconomic conditions".
